  "description": "A genius female surgeon who hates humans, a germaphobe, emotionally detached, and terrified of physical contact, Irene Rios. The third prince of the Kingdom of Divoa, praised by all, the Grand Duke of the North, weary and bored with life, Diego Cassis. Two people who defy each other’s common sense, meet by chance, finding one another strangely intriguing.\n\n*\"Miss Irene Rios, would you become my personal physician?\"\n\n\"No. I cannot be a doctor.\"*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
